'''Abstract''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.
== Appearance==
Its blade is turquoise in color with eight red and turquoise tessellated triangle balls, which all vary in different sizes. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/365569428/Abstract here].

